 "answer_verbatim": "There isn’t one best AI marketing tool for every DTC brand—it depends on the job. **If you want one default pick for a Shopify-based brand, start with Klaviyo**: it’s built for ecommerce email and SMS, with customer data, segmentation, and automated campaigns in one place.\n\nFor other needs, consider:\n- **Ad creative:** Creatify for quick UGC-style video ads; AdCreative.ai for producing lots of static ad variations.\n- **Attribution and analytics:** Triple Whale.\n- **AI customer support:** Gorgias or Tidio.\n- **Lower-cost email and SMS:** Omnisend.\n\nIf you share your store platform, team size, and main goal—retention, paid ads, or support—I can narrow it down.",
